// the editor can see: an address a record already holds, and a range that ends before it starts. They
// are the editor's own courtesy, not the domain's rules: the domain is the authority, and a model
// that has no such rule still accepts what is refused here from any other client. Each check says,
// in plain words, what to change, and names the field to mark.
